Description: Utility functions for clinical trials and data science:
    descriptive statistics (summaries, quartiles, median CI, geometric mean),
    SDTM/ADaM helpers (date conversion, supplemental merge, XPT batch load),
    table builders (AE summary, medical history), batch data loading,
    and small helpers (trim, z-score, CV, lag, SWOE, AUC, EAIR).
